      "en": "I will also strike my hands together, and I will cause my wrath to rest. I, the LORD, have spoken it.”",
      "ko": "나도 내 손뼉을 치며 내 분을 다 하리로다 나 여호와의 말이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ee46e47a6dfd90b29c035dce86a79ef978b3cdf4c38f24bc47490b35b60c93f9",
      "translation_text_hash": "5ace2fb43843466ac4a97f865cc19a9dcd80759a7c80a6db5faf0967d91ed7a6",
