      "en": "the Lord GOD says: “Remove the turban, and take off the crown. This will not be as it was. Exalt that which is low, and humble that which is high.",
      "ko": "나 주 여호와가 말하노라 관을 제하며 면류관을 벗길찌라 그대로 두지 못하리니 낮은 자를 높이고 높은 자를 낮출 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e3a0a405638eb8165026bcf463e3d4cd9da058783970d4230cf4d811a5921e07",
      "translation_text_hash": "3281a5854cd12ce84701ae6ba0f3c4f15a6494486bfd7687ac7815d7a3e2dff2",
